# vhs tape — quickstart→sync demo (BEA-4 content-calendar rev 3, BEA-33).
# Render: vhs demo.tape  (from this directory)
Output demo-quickstart.gif
Output demo-quickstart.mp4

Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1200
Set Height 640
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 1ms

Hide
Type "sh demo-script.sh; exit"
Enter
Show
Sleep 32s
